      'Moyenne des sondages publiés, avec plus de poids pour les récents et les grands échantillons. Chaque institut est corrigé de son biais mesuré face aux autres ; les réestimations du CIS par des tiers ne comptent pas.',
      'Le vote national est transposé dans chaque province à partir des générales de 2023. Les nouveaux partis partent de leur dernier résultat : SALF des européennes 2024, Aliança Catalana et Adelante Andalucía de leurs élections régionales.',
      `Chaque simulation ajoute l'erreur réelle des sondages en Espagne (mesurée de 2015 à 2023), un effet par communauté et un par province, puis répartit les sièges avec D'Hondt et le seuil de 3 %. ${meta.n_draws.toLocaleString('fr-FR')} simulations.`,
      `Suppose un vote le ${longDate(meta.election_day_assumed)}. La répartition des sièges par province est calculée sur la population de l'INE jusqu'à la publication officielle au BOE.`,
    ],
  },
  en: {
    title: `Spain General Election: Polls, Seat Projection & Date — PP ${nat.pp.seats_median}, PSOE ${psoe.seats_median}, Vox ${nat.vox.seats_median} — Vote-Scope`,
    description: `Spanish election polls and a projection of all 350 Congress seats, province by province. PP and Vox win a majority in ${pct(blocs.pp_vox.p_majority)} of 100 simulations. Possible dates for a snap election.`,
    eyebrow: 'Spain Desk · Congress of Deputies',
    h1: 'Spain general election: polls and seat projection',
    promise: `We project all 350 seats in Congress province by province, with the D'Hondt rule and the 3% threshold, from ${meta.n_polls_window} recent polls corrected for each pollster's lean.`,
    whenLabel: 'When is the next Spanish election?',
    whenAnswer: 'Not called yet. If the dissolution decree is published on October 6, Spain votes on Sunday, November 29. The legal deadline is August 22, 2027.',
    whenLink: 'Every possible date',
    headline: `On today's polls, PP and Vox win an outright majority in ${pct(blocs.pp_vox.p_majority)} of 100 simulations.`,
    seats: 'seats',
    vote: 'of the vote',
    range: 'likely range',
    majority: 'Majority: 176',
    updated: `Updated ${runDate} · latest poll ${meta.last_poll_field_end}`,
    since2023: (k: string) => k === 'sumar' ? '31 in 2023 with Podemos' : `${nat[k].seats_2023 ? `${nat[k].seats_2023} in 2023` : 'new'}`,
    adelantoKicker: 'Does a snap election pay?',
    adelantoTitle: 'What the numbers tell the person who has to decide.',
    adelantoRows: [
      { label: 'PSOE', value: `${psoe.seats_median} seats`, note: `121 in 2023 · range ${psoe.seats_p10}–${psoe.seats_p90}` },
      { label: 'The bloc that re-elected Sánchez in 2023', value: `${blocs.investiture_2023.median} seats`, note: `179 in 2023 · majority in ${pct(blocs.investiture_2023.p_majority)} of 100 simulations` },
      { label: 'PP + Vox', value: `${blocs.pp_vox.median} seats`, note: `range ${blocs.pp_vox.p10}–${blocs.pp_vox.p90} · majority in ${pct(blocs.pp_vox.p_majority)} of 100` },
      { label: 'PP alone', value: `${nat.pp.seats_median} seats`, note: `outright majority in ${pct(blocs.pp_alone.p_majority)} of 100` },
    ],
    adelantoBody: `Today's polls give no arithmetic reason to go early: the PSOE would lose about ${121 - psoe.seats_median} seats and the 2023 majority would be out of reach. A snap election would come from elsewhere: deadlock in Congress, the calendar, or a bet that the campaign moves votes.`,
    leftKicker: 'The split left of the PSOE',
    leftTitle: `Running apart, Sumar and Podemos win ${leftDivided} seats. Together, on the same votes, they would win ${united.sumar_podemos_seats_median}.`,
    leftBody: `D'Hondt punishes mid-sized parties that split in small provinces. The gap (${leftGain} seats) is bigger than most groups in Congress.`,
    vivKicker: 'Housing · the issue behind the snap election',
    vivTitle: `Housing went from ${dec(viv2022)}% in 2022 to ${dec(viv2026)}% in 2026: it is now what worries Spaniards most.`,
    vivLede: `Share of Spaniards naming housing among the country’s top three problems, CIS barometer month by month. In ${monthYear(viv.latest.field_end)}: ${dec(viv.latest.pct_multi)}%, ahead of the economy and immigration. ${dec(viv.latest.pct_personal)}% say it affects them personally.`,
    vivChartLabel: 'Names housing among Spain’s main problems (%)',
    vivDecree: 'Dashed line: October 2, 2026, Congress votes down the housing decrees.',
    vivTopicsTitle: `What worries Spaniards most (CIS, ${monthYear(viv.latest.field_end)})`,
    vivTrustTitle: 'Which party would handle housing best?',
    vivTrustFirm: `40dB for El País and SER`,
    vivTrustBody: `Nobody convinces: “none” is the most common answer (${dec(trustLast.options.ninguno)}%). The PSOE still leads (${dec(trustLast.options.psoe)}%) but is down ${vivPoints(delta('psoe') ?? 0)} points since January 2025; the PP is down ${vivPoints(delta('pp') ?? 0)} and Vox holds (${dec(trustLast.options.vox)}%). So far the crisis has no clear winner.`,
    vivNotPublished: 'not published',
    vivTable: 'See the data by year',
    vivYear: 'Year',
    vivAvg: 'Average',
    vivSource: 'Source: CIS monthly barometers (multiple-answer question: up to three problems).',
    calendarKicker: 'Possible dates',
    calendarTitle: 'When Spain would vote, depending on the dissolution date',
    calendarBody: 'Polling day falls 54 days after the dissolution decree is published in the official gazette (BOE).',
    calBoe: 'Decree in the BOE',
    calVote: 'Polling day',
    cal2027: 'In 2027, May 23 already brings municipal elections and votes in many of the autonomous communities.',
    calLimit: 'Deadline: Sunday, August 22, 2027, with dissolution no later than June 28, 2027.',
    provKicker: 'Province by province',
    provTitle: 'Where the last seat is decided',
    provBody: 'In these provinces the last seat changes hands on a handful of votes. That is where the majority is won.',
    provSwing: 'Seat in play for',
    provAllTitle: 'All 52 constituencies',
    provCol: 'Province',
    seatsCol: 'Seats',
    projCol: 'Most likely split',
    probCol: 'Chance',
    trackKicker: 'Why trust it',
    trackTitle: 'Tested on past elections before going live.',
    trackBody: `Using eve-of-election polls, this method would have misplaced ${meta.backtest.es_2023.seats_misplaced} of 350 seats in 2023 and ${meta.backtest.es_2019n.seats_misplaced} in November 2019. The real result landed inside our ranges ${Math.round(meta.backtest.es_2023.inside90 * 100)} times out of 100.`,
    trackClacton: `In the Clacton by-election (U.K., August 13, 2026) we projected Nigel Farage at ${dec(clacton.farage_projected_median)}%: he won ${dec(clacton.farage_actual)}%, with Count Binface second, as forecast.`,
    trackMore: [
      'We were among the first models to flag that Texas could tip toward the Democrats.',
      `Before the 2026 international football tournament, our model had Spain as title favourite (1st of ${football.n_teams} teams). Spain won the final.`,
    ],
    methodTitle: 'How it works',
    methodBody: 'A polling average, carried into every province and allocated under the real electoral law, thousands of times.',
    methodBullets: [
      'An average of published polls, weighting recent polls and large samples more. Each pollster is corrected for its measured lean against the others; third-party re-estimates of CIS data are left out.',
      'The national vote is carried into each province from the 2023 general election. New parties start from their latest result: SALF from the 2024 European election, Aliança Catalana and Adelante Andalucía from their regional elections.',
      `Each simulation adds the real error of Spanish polls (measured 2015–2023), a regional effect and a provincial effect, then allocates seats under D'Hondt with the 3% threshold. ${meta.n_draws.toLocaleString('en-GB')} simulations.`,
      `Assumes polling day on ${longDate(meta.election_day_assumed)}. Seats per province are computed from INE population until the official BOE allocation is published.`,
    ],
  },
}[locale];
const t = copy;

const canonical = `https://vote-scope.com/${locale}/spain/`;
const alternates = {
  en: 'https://vote-scope.com/en/spain/',
  fr: 'https://vote-scope.com/fr/spain/',
  es: 'https://vote-scope.com/es/spain/',
};
const jsonLd = [
  {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'CollectionPage',
    name: t.title,
    url: canonical,
    inLanguage: locale,
    dateModified: meta.run_date,
  },
  {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'FAQPage',
    mainEntity: [
      {
        '@type': 'Question',
        name: t.whenLabel,
        acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: t.whenAnswer },
      },
    ],
  },
  {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
    itemListElement: [
      { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Vote-Scope', item: `https://vote-scope.com/${locale}/` },
      { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: locale === 'en' ? 'Spain' : locale === 'fr' ? 'Espagne' : 'España', item: canonical },
    ],
  },
];

const barTotal = 350;


---

<EditorialLayout
  title={t.title}
  description={t.description}
  canonical={canonical}
  lang={locale}
  currentPage="spain"
  alternates={alternates}
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  <article class="es-desk" data-content-area>
    <header class="es-head">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">{t.eyebrow}</p>
        <h1>{t.h1}</h1>

        <div class="es-when">
          <span class="es-when-label">{t.whenLabel}</span>
          <p>{t.whenAnswer} <a href="#fechas">{t.whenLink} →</a></p>
        </div>

        <p class="es-headline">{t.headline}</p>

        <div class="es-bar" role="img" aria-label={withSeats.map((k) => `${name(k)} ${nat[k].seats_median}`).join(', ')}>
          {withSeats.map((k) => (
            <div style={`width:${(nat[k].seats_median / barTotal) * 100}%;background:${color(k)};`} title={`${name(k)}: ${nat[k].seats_median}`} />
          ))}
          <span class="es-bar-majority" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </div>
        <p class="es-bar-caption">{t.majority}</p>

        <div class="es-tiles">
          {top.map((k) => (
            <div class="es-tile" style={`--party-color:${color(k)}`}>
              <span class="es-tile-party">{name(k)}</span>
              <strong>{nat[k].seats_median}</strong>
              <span class="es-tile-sub">{t.seats} · {nat[k].seats_p10}–{nat[k].seats_p90}</span>
              <span class="es-tile-sub">{dec(nat[k].vote_mean)} % {t.vote} · {t.since2023(k)}</span>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
        <p class="es-updated">{t.updated}</p>
        <GooglePreferredSource locale={locale} />
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="content-band">
      <div class="container es-two">
        <div class="note-card es-adelanto">
          <p class="eyebrow">{t.adelantoKicker}</p>
          <h2>{t.adelantoTitle}</h2>
          <dl>
            {t.adelantoRows.map((r) => (
              <div>
                <dt>{r.label}</dt>
                <dd><strong>{r.value}</strong><span>{r.note}</span></dd>
              </div>
            ))}
          </dl>
          <p>{t.adelantoBody}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="note-card es-left">
          <p class="eyebrow">{t.leftKicker}</p>
          <h2>{t.leftTitle}</h2>
          <p>{t.leftBody}</p>
          <div class="es-left-compare">
            <div><span style={`background:${color('sumar')}`}></span>Sumar {nat.sumar.seats_median} + Podemos {nat.podemos.seats_median} = {leftDivided}</div>
            <div><span style={`background:${color('sumar')}`}></span>Sumar + Podemos = {united.sumar_podemos_seats_median} ({united.p10}–{united.p90})</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-band es-viv" id="vivienda">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">{t.vivKicker}</p>
        <h2 class="es-h2">{t.vivTitle}</h2>
        <p class="es-lede">{t.vivLede}</p>
        <figure class="es-viv-chart" data-locale={locale}>
          <figcaption>{t.vivChartLabel}</figcaption>
          <div class="es-viv-plot">
            <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${CH.w} ${CH.h}`} role="img" aria-label={`${t.vivChartLabel}: ${dec(vSeries[0].v)} % (${monthYear(vSeries[0].d)}) → ${dec(vLast.v)} % (${monthYear(vLast.d)})`}>
              {[0, 10, 20, 30, 40, 50].map((g) => (
                <g>
                  <line x1={CH.l} x2={CH.w - CH.r} y1={vy(g)} y2={vy(g)} class={g === 0 ? 'es-axis' : 'es-grid'} />
                  <text x={CH.l - 8} y={vy(g) + 4} class="es-tick" text-anchor="end">{g}</text>
                </g>
              ))}
              {vYears.map((y) => (
                <text x={vx(`${y}-01-01`)} y={CH.h - 8} class="es-tick" text-anchor="middle">{y}</text>
              ))}
              <line x1={vDecree} x2={vDecree} y1={CH.t} y2={vy(0)} class="es-event" />
              <path d={vArea} class="es-viv-area" />
              <path d={vPath} class="es-viv-line" />
              <circle cx={vx(vLast.d)} cy={vy(vLast.v)} r="4.5" class="es-viv-end" />
              <text x={vx(vLast.d) + 9} y={vy(vLast.v) + 4} class="es-viv-endlabel">{dec(vLast.v)} %</text>
              <line class="es-viv-cross" x1="0" x2="0" y1={CH.t} y2={vy(0)} visibility="hidden" />
              <circle class="es-viv-dot" r="5" cx="0" cy="0" visibility="hidden" />
              <rect class="es-viv-hit" x={CH.l} y={CH.t} width={CH.w - CH.l - CH.r} height={CH.h - CH.t - CH.b} />
            </svg>
            <div class="es-viv-tip" hidden></div>
            <script type="application/json" class="es-viv-data" set:html={JSON.stringify(vSeries.map((p) => [p.d, p.v, vx(p.d), vy(p.v)]))} />
          </div>
          <p class="es-source"><span class="es-dash" aria-hidden="true"></span>{t.vivDecree}</p>
          <details class="es-viv-table">
            <summary>{t.vivTable}</summary>
            <table class="es-table">
              <thead><tr><th>{t.vivYear}</th><th>{t.vivAvg}</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody>
                {Object.entries(viv.yearly).map(([y, v]) => (
                  <tr><td>{y}</td><td class="num">{dec(v as number)} %</td></tr>
                ))}
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </details>
          <p class="es-source">{t.vivSource} <a href={viv.latest.source_url} rel="noopener">CIS {viv.latest.study_id}</a></p>
        </figure>

        <div class="es-two es-viv-two">
          <div class="note-card">
            <h3 class="es-h3 es-h3-tight">{t.vivTopicsTitle}</h3>
            <ul class="es-topics">
              {topics.map((x) => (
                <li class={x.problem_id === 'vivienda' ? 'is-viv' : ''}>
                  <span class="es-topic-name">{TOPIC[x.problem_id]?.[locale] ?? x.problem_id}</span>
                  <span class="es-topic-bar"><i style={`width:${(x.pct / topicMax) * 100}%`}></i></span>
                  <span class="es-topic-val">{dec(x.pct)} %</span>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="note-card">
            <h3 class="es-h3 es-h3-tight">{t.vivTrustTitle}</h3>
            <table class="es-table es-trust">
              <thead>
                <tr><th></th><th>{monthYear(trustFirst.field_end)}</th><th>{monthYear(trustLast.field_end)}</th></tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                {TRUST_ROWS.map((k) => (
                  <tr>
                    <td><i class="es-swatch" style={`background:${k === 'ninguno' ? 'var(--ink-3)' : color(k)}`}></i>{trustName(k)}</td>
                    <td class="num">{trustFirst.options[k] != null ? `${dec(trustFirst.options[k])} %` : t.vivNotPublished}</td>
                    <td class="num">{trustLast.options[k] != null ? `${dec(trustLast.options[k])} %` : t.vivNotPublished}</td>
                  </tr>
                ))}
              </tbody>
            </table>
            <p class="es-viv-trustbody">{t.vivTrustBody}</p>
            <p class="es-source"><a href={trustLast.source_url} rel="noopener">{t.vivTrustFirm}</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-band" id="fechas">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">{t.calendarKicker}</p>
        <h2 class="es-h2">{t.calendarTitle}</h2>
        <p class="es-lede">{t.calendarBody}</p>
        <table class="es-table es-cal">
          <thead><tr><th>{t.calBoe}</th><th>{t.calVote}</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            {WINDOWS.map((w) => (
              <tr><td>{capFirst(longDate(w.boe))}</td><td><strong>{capFirst(longDate(w.vote))}</strong></td></tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p class="es-lede">{t.cal2027}</p>
        <p class="es-lede"><strong>{t.calLimit}</strong></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-band">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">{t.provKicker}</p>
        <h2 class="es-h2">{t.provTitle}</h2>
        <p class="es-lede">{t.provBody}</p>
        <div class="es-contested">
          {contested.map((p) => (
            <div class="es-prov-card">
              <h3>{p.name} <span>{p.seats} {t.seats}</span></h3>
              <p class="es-chips">
                {Object.entries(p.modal)
                  .sort((a, b) => b[1] - a[1])
                  .map(([k, n]) => (
                    <span style={`--party-color:${color(k)}`}>{name(k)} {n}</span>
                  ))}
              </p>
              {p.swing.length > 0 && (
                <p class="es-swing">{t.provSwing} {p.swing.map((k) => `${name(k)} (${pct(p.parties[k].p_at_least_one)} %)`).join(', ')}</p>
              )}
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>

        <h3 class="es-h3">{t.provAllTitle}</h3>
        <div class="es-table-wrap">
          <table class="es-table">
            <thead><tr><th>{t.provCol}</th><th>{t.seatsCol}</th><th>{t.projCol}</th><th>{t.probCol}</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              {provinceRows.map((p) => (
                <tr>
                  <td>{p.name}</td>
                  <td class="num">{p.seats}</td>
                  <td class="es-chips">
                    {Object.entries(p.modal)
                      .sort((a, b) => b[1] - a[1])
                      .map(([k, n]) => (
                        <span style={`--party-color:${color(k)}`}>{name(k)} {n}</span>
                      ))}
                  </td>
                  <td class="num">{pct(p.p_modal)} %</td>
                </tr>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-band">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="note-card es-track">
          <p class="eyebrow">{t.trackKicker}</p>
          <h2>{t.trackTitle}</h2>
          <p>{t.trackBody}</p>
          <p>{t.trackClacton}</p>
          {t.trackMore.map((x) => <p>{x}</p>)}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <MethodologyNote title={t.methodTitle} body={t.methodBody} bullets={t.methodBullets} />
  </article>
</EditorialLayout>

<script>
  // Info-bulle de la courbe logement : point le plus proche en x.
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.es-viv-chart').forEach((fig) => {
    const svg = fig.querySelector('svg');
    const hit = fig.querySelector<SVGRectElement>('.es-viv-hit');
    const cross = fig.querySelector<SVGLineElement>('.es-viv-cross');
    const dot = fig.querySelector<SVGCircleElement>('.es-viv-dot');
    const tip = fig.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.es-viv-tip');
    const raw = fig.querySelector('.es-viv-data')?.textContent;
    if (!svg || !hit || !cross || !dot || !tip || !raw) return;
    const pts = JSON.parse(raw) as [string, number, number, number][];
    const loc = fig.dataset.locale === 'en' ? 'en-GB' : fig.dataset.locale === 'fr' ? 'fr-FR' : 'es-ES';
    const vb = svg.viewBox.baseVal;
    const show = (clientX: number) => {
      const box = svg.getBoundingClientRect();
      const x = ((clientX - box.left) / box.width) * vb.width;
      let best = pts[0];
      for (const p of pts) if (Math.abs(p[2] - x) < Math.abs(best[2] - x)) best = p;
      cross.setAttribute('x1', String(best[2]));
      cross.setAttribute('x2', String(best[2]));
      dot.setAttribute('cx', String(best[2]));
      dot.setAttribute('cy', String(best[3]));
      cross.setAttribute('visibility', 'visible');
      dot.setAttribute('visibility', 'visible');
      const month = new Date(`${best[0]}T12:00:00`).toLocaleDateString(loc, { month: 'long', year: 'numeric' });
      const val = loc === 'en-GB' ? best[1].toFixed(1) : best[1].toFixed(1).replace('.', ',');
      tip.textContent = `${month} · ${val} %`;
      tip.hidden = false;
      tip.style.left = `${(best[2] / vb.width) * box.width}px`;
      tip.style.top = `${(best[3] / vb.height) * box.height - 10}px`;
    };
    const hide = () => {
      cross.setAttribute('visibility', 'hidden');
      dot.setAttribute('visibility', 'hidden');
      tip.hidden = true;
    };
    hit.addEventListener('pointermove', (e) => show(e.clientX));
    hit.addEventListener('pointerleave', hide);
  });
</script>

<style>
  .es-head {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, color-mix(in oklab, var(--paper) 90%, var(--blue-tint)), var(--paper));
    padding: 34px 0 26px;
  }
  .es-head h1 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    margin: 0.35rem 0 1rem;
    max-width: 22ch;
  }
  .es-when {
    max-width: 760px;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--blue);
    padding: 8px 0 8px 14px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .es-when-label {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  .es-when p { margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .es-headline {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2.2vw, 1.5rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    max-width: 46ch;
  }
  .es-bar { position: relative; display: flex; height: 22px; border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden; }
  .es-bar-majority {
    position: absolute;
    left: calc(176 / 350 * 100%);
    top: -4px;
    bottom: -4px;
    width: 2px;
    background: var(--ink);
  }
  .es-bar-caption { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-3); margin: 6px 0 0; padding-left: calc(176 / 350 * 100% - 40px); }
  .es-tiles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 10px; margin-top: 16px; }
  .es-tile {
